  "location": "CRE31.6",
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "title": "Basel Framework: CRE31.6",
      "summary": "CRE31.6 cites CRE32.43-32.54 for effective maturity, but the maturity rules are CRE32.44-32.55, so the cross-reference is off by one at both ends.",
      "impact": "Position: Corporate facility under A-IRB with no explicit maturity definition, PD 1%, LGD 45%, EAD 100. Reading a: Literal range CRE32.43-32.54: the CRE32.55 default is not part of the cited calculation, M is not defined, so no RWA. Reading b: Intended range CRE32.44-32.55: M = 2.5 and RWA is computed. Difference: RWA undefined vs defined",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
  },
